<title>UK: Weekend EU monetary meeting all but certain - source.</title>
<headline>Weekend EU monetary meeting all but certain - source.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union monetary committee is all but certain to meet this weekend to decide on Italy re-entering the exchange rate mechanism, a source said.</p>
<p>&quot;I am sure you will not get a denial of this in Frankfurt, you are on the right track,&quot; said the source from a European government, referring to the Banking Congress in Frankfurt where many of the leading players in the ERM debate were on Friday.</p>
<p>A senior source on the sidelines of the congress earlier told Reuters that Italy had requested a meeting of the monetary committee for Saturday. -- London Newsroom 44-171 542-8974</p>
